WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.490
A market street.

2
00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:06.560
Stalls, awnings, crates stacked
high, people everywhere.

3
00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:08.810
Your task: describe it.

4
00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:12.260
One rule: you can't use the word busy.

5
00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:13.790
So you point the camera.

6
00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:18.510
It pans left, then right, trying
to fit the whole street in at once.

7
00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:19.830
It wobbles.

8
00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:23.370
Without that one word, where
should the camera stop?

9
00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:26.320
In this mission, you'll
test some ways to point it.

10
00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:27.640
Everywhere at once?

11
00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:29.420
Up at the sky first?

12
00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:31.700
You'll learn the different
shots a camera can take,

13
00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:33.720
and what each one can show.

14
00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:36.660
And you'll shape a description
with no plot at all,

15
00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:38.410
just one moment.

16
00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:41.580
Your mission: work out
where to point the camera.
